        {
          "text": "nzimwakali kweendela mulinzizyo insiku, cakutobela ziimbo zyaansi ano azyamweendelezi uujisi bwami bwakumuuwo, nguwenya muuya uubeleka sunu mumyoyo yabana bakasampusampu. ",
