          "text": "Mumubili wakwe wakalobya businkondo, nkukuti milazyo iibikidwe mu-Mulao, aboobo wakacita luumuno, nkaambo kuzwa kulibaaba bobile wakalenga mukati kakwe mwini muntu omwe mupya, ",
